dotfiles
========

Config files for zsh, git, vim, and neovim.
Managed with symlinks (edit in the repo -> changes are live).


Setup (new machine)
-------------------

  git clone https://github.com/FrankKair/dotfiles.git ~/Documents/dotfiles
  cd ~/Documents/dotfiles

  ./bootstrap.sh         # install core tools
  ./bootstrap.sh --home  # include personal apps
  ./install.sh           # symlink config files + clone neovim config


Revert
------

  ./uninstall.sh         # restore original config from backups
